  "originalQuery": "A Database Engineer is working on optimizing the security settings for a Cloud SQL instance using the Cloud SQL Auth Proxy. Which of the following actions should the engineer take to ensure a secure connection to the instance while minimizing the attack surface?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Use the default settings for the Cloud SQL Auth Proxy without any modifications.<br/>B. Enable SSL connections for the proxy but disable certificate validation.<br/>C. Configure the proxy to use SSL connections with a client certificate, a server certificate, and a private key.<br/>D. Configure the proxy to use a service account with the least privileges.",
  "domain": "Deploy scalable and highly available databases in Google Cloud",
