  "tip": "<p>When questions mention the Cloud SQL Auth Proxy, look for options that use <i>least privilege</i> with a dedicated service account and that limit exposure to <i>localhost</i>. Be cautious of answers that open listeners on <i>0.0.0.0</i> or that disable <i>certificate verification</i>.</p>",
